{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lumora is a 3D cartoon-stylized adventure where you play as a girl exploring a mysterious and dangerous world. Dive into dungeons filled with acid lakes, moving platforms, and deadly traps that will test your reflexes and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main weapon is a magic staff, capable of defeating enemies and helping you progress. Each dungeon hides unique challenges and epic bosses that demand both agility and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game blends platforming, action, and exploration into one vivid experience. Behind its colorful style lies a world full of challenges, where every step brings something new to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Atmospheric dungeons full of traps and puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A magic staff as both weapon and tool</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Parkour across moving platforms and hazardous zones</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Intense boss battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bright cartoon visuals and a magical atmosphere</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000240?t=1757536356","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4000240?t=1757536356","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000240/d0b68bd52b3de497e433bf4d7896809515f66a6c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757536356","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000240/d0b68bd52b3de497e433bf4d7896809515f66a6c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757536356","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lumora is a 3D cartoon-stylized adventure where you play as a girl exploring a mysterious and dangerous world. Dive into dungeons filled with acid lakes, moving platforms, and deadly traps that will test your reflexes and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your main weapon is a magic staff, capable of defeating enemies and helping you progress. Each dungeon hides unique challenges and epic bosses that demand both agility and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game blends platforming, action, and exploration into one vivid experience. Behind its colorful style lies a world full of challenges, where every step brings something new to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Atmospheric dungeons full of traps and puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A magic staff as both weapon and tool</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Parkour across moving platforms and hazardous zones</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Intense boss battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bright cartoon visuals and a magical atmosphere</p>","developers":["g4m3d3s1gn studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4000240/a960cfe73c42d40e8710a967994d338d60215892/header.jpg?t=1757536356","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4000240/542931513/500d70b930cd40902724717318a094b155add054/1756826030/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757536355","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4000240/542931513/500d70b930cd40902724717318a094b155add054/1756826030/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757536355","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4000240/542931513/500d70b930cd40902724717318a094b155add054/1756826030/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757536355","id":257192249,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257192249/movie480.mp4?t=1757536355","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store